==Strategy==
This stage is actually quite simple due to the amount of Super Rares that are helpful here. All you have to do is outlast the enemies until you can reach and kill Kurosawah. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]], and [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catyphoon]] can all be used to great effect. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] can also be helpful in sniping away Darkmadillo, allowing your Critical Hitters to actually land attacks.

